<title>USA: Mothers Work sees Q4 shr loss.</title>
<headline>Mothers Work sees Q4 shr loss.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mothers Work Inc said on Monday it expects a loss of $0.50 to $0.60 a share for the fourth quarter ended September.</p>
<p>In last year's fourth quarter, Mothers Work reported a loss of $1.63 a share on sales of $38.8 million.</p>
<p>The company said its cash flow for the quarter is $4 million.</p>
<p>The company said September's sales were the highest in its history, but it was not enough to offset sales below management's expectations in July and August.</p>
</text>
